WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:50.054 --> 00:00:52.054
Dear Devia,

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.620
I miss you.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:01.380
I'm sorry I haven't contacted you after...

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.380
what happened.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.380
I'm not scared,

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:07.380
It's more than fear.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.060
*moaning/crying sounds*

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.060
There's a second element at play.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.060
*moaning/crying sounds*

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.060
I keep trying to reel you back, but

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.800
something bigger than fear keeps cutting my strings.

00:01:23.174 --> 00:01:25.174
but

00:01:25.174 --> 00:01:27.734
I've decided to stand up to fear.

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:29.734
Like a steel cable.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.860
Remember when I took you to the fair?

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.980
You wanted that red balloon.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.660
You were a beautiful love song

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.280
and I just had to put the needle to the record.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.500
But, I couldn't hold on to that red balloon.

00:02:34.034 --> 00:02:36.034
So we watched it float away together.

00:02:40.654 --> 00:02:42.654
It drifted in the autumn air until it was

00:02:42.654 --> 00:02:43.994
just a speck.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.440
And then,

00:02:47.214 --> 00:02:49.214
It was nothing at all.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.720
I can't remember being that... happy.

00:02:59.174 --> 00:03:01.174
I like to think it's still up there.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.980
Somewhere.

00:03:04.254 --> 00:03:06.254
Eventually it will run out of hot air

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.960
And sink back down into my arms.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.774
But I know that.

00:03:10.774 --> 00:03:12.400
Will take time.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.620
I cannot ask you to forgive me for what I did.

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.620
But I'd like to ask you to move on.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.940
I wish you could know how hard

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.594
I've been trying to try again.

00:03:26.094 --> 00:03:28.094
I've got the air back in my lungs,

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.620
but I still can't breathe without you.

00:03:32.794 --> 00:03:34.794
I hope this letter finds you better than I've been

00:03:34.794 --> 00:03:35.714
the last few months.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.780
and I'd really like to hear your song again sometime.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.320
Sincerely, Fetter.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:26.780
*POP!*

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.080
 Fetter.

00:04:40.714 --> 00:04:42.714
Can't you take a damn hint?

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.940
There is NOTHING you can do

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.214
to make me love you again.

00:04:46.214 --> 00:04:47.420
So just stop.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.960
I guess nobody bothered to relay you the  message.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.800
Then again, you're so DISGUSTING, 

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:54.777
Why should they?

00:04:57.048 --> 00:04:59.048
I left the world of the living.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:11.240
*moaning / crying*

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.860
After...

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.940
What you did to me.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.460
I couldn't go on living in the 

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.754
same world as you.

00:05:22.754 --> 00:05:24.153
The thought of breathing

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.920
The same air as you is NAUSEATING Fetter.

00:05:27.008 --> 00:05:29.008
You single-handedly ruined

00:05:29.008 --> 00:05:30.354
the joy of life for me!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.360
Your pathetic efforts just sicken me.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.820
Where I am now is infinitely better.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.700
I have suitors who will go at

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.408
any length to please me.

00:05:50.408 --> 00:05:52.368
They will do my bidding.

00:05:52.368 --> 00:05:53.740
If you don't leave me alone,

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:58.620
they will haunt you every moment of every day.

00:06:01.034 --> 00:06:03.034
So there you go.

00:06:03.654 --> 00:06:05.654
I have given you fair warning.

00:06:07.775 --> 00:06:09.775
The most I can do is bid you

00:06:09.775 --> 00:06:10.974
a cold farewell.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.900
Devia.

